HHIISSTTOORRYY
     ttuunn interfaces originally supported both Layer 3 and Ethernet packets by
     reconfiguring the type of interface with TUNSIFINFO.  Ethernet packet
     support was split into the separate ttaapp interface in OpenBSD 5.9.

